      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.3,
      "end_seconds": 21.88,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a new headache at the temple. I just wanna get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
