      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.37,
      "end_seconds": 123.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "okay, can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.9,
      "end_seconds": 131.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "I'm on omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.78,
      "end_seconds": 138.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "What about your medical history? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.2,
      "end_seconds": 155.8,
      "duration_seconds": 15.6,
      "text": "I've had acid reflux for five years now. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.69,
      "end_seconds": 158.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
